        <p class="text-ink/60 text-lg leading-relaxed mt-8"><%= (t.longTerm && t.longTerm.intro) || 'Monthly and long-stay car rentals for expats, digital nomads, and long-term visitors with preferential rates the longer you stay. Every rental comes with full insurance, free hotel or condo delivery, and 24/7 support as standard.' %></p>
